noether 0.1
## Quantum Fourier transform, Nielsen & Chuang convention: r[0] is the most significant bit.
## QFT_{r}|x⟩ = 2^{-n/2} Σ_y e^{2πi·x·y/2^n} |y⟩. Use QFT†_r for the inverse.
def QFT_{r[n]}:
    for j in 0..n-1:
        H_{r[j]}
        for k in j+1..n-1:
            C_{r[k]}(P(π/2^(k-j))_{r[j]})
    for j in 0..floor(n/2)-1:
        SWAP_{r[j], r[n-1-j]}

## QFT without the final bit reversal: the output register is read in reverse order.
def QFTNoSwap_{r[n]}:
    for j in 0..n-1:
        H_{r[j]}
        for k in j+1..n-1:
            C_{r[k]}(P(π/2^(k-j))_{r[j]})
